        "original_id": "e8af0d0e-ddb7-57b8-bcb8-68b9eedefb97",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nigel Godrich, Johnny Greenwood, Stanley Donwood, John Leckie\n- Bands: Radiohead, The Stone Roses\n- Albums: The Bends, Pablo Honey, The Stone Roses\n- Songs: Planet Telex\n- Roles: producer, engineer, controller, artist\n\nFacts:\n- John Leckie produced Radiohead's album \"The Bends,\" and John Leckie also produced The Stone Roses' album \"The Stone Roses.\"\n- Nigel Godrich engineered Radiohead's album \"The Bends.\"\n- Stanley Donwood created the artwork for Radiohead's album \"The Bends,\" and Stanley Donwood also created the artwork for another Radiohead album, \"Pablo Honey.\"\n- Johnny Greenwood is credited as the controller on Radiohead's album \"The Bends.\"\n- \"Planet Telex\" is the opening track on Radiohead's album \"The Bends.\"",
